    "orientation": "8 CPU slots include native directional flips. Slots6/7 derive only from exact full-canvas RGBA mirror proof of2/3; direction_mirror_x empty.",
    "alpha_policy": "Retained pixels keep ImageGen alpha. Manually isolated grounded boot ROI excludes weapon. X uses opaque sole alpha>=128, Y visible sole alpha>4. Only outside-canvas noise alpha<=4 may be cropped.",
    "limits": [
